T ALL in this development\n5. when i now enter the settings section i get a App Error Detected Can't find variable: Trash2\n6. i need the ability to import databases from backup locations.  for example, i should be able to export it locally, send it as an email or back it up on onedrive or google drive.  if i need to recoved it, i need a seemless way to import it back in as well\n7. I need you to step through this code line by line, function by function, module by module and ensure there are no hidden bugs or edge cases thus far in development and optimize the code where it would be beneficial to performance and stability\n8. i would like for you to go through every aspect of the program and change the color pallet to be in alignment with my website color pallet at 5treesfellowship.church.  the app should employ world class best practices in the realm of ux/ui design for mobile apps\n9. report on your finding and corrections, if any, during the edge/bug/optimization analysis a couple of turns ago please\n10. The Ai text messages seem to be errant.  They never seem to produce a complete text.  I need it to produce a clean, clear, friendly yet professional text, drawing from information on the scanned report cards...particularly if they wrote something or noted something in their own words.\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Fix Truncated / Errant AI SMS Generation & Enhance Quality with Report Card Personalization:**\n  - *User Directive:* `\"The Ai text messages seem to be errant. They never seem to produce a complete text. I need it to produce a clean, clear, friendly yet professional text, drawing from information on the scanned report cards...particularly if they wrote something or noted something in their own words.\"`\n  - *Status:* **PLANNING & IMPLEMENTATION**\n  - *Root Cause Identified:* In `src/services/aiSmsService.ts`, `generationConfig.maxOutputTokens` was set to `180` (which is extremely small and causes mid-sentence token cutoff/truncation!). Additionally, the prompt requires better framing to naturally highlight the teacher's handwritten notes/questions, planning period, and FRS interests in a complete, friendly, professional SMS message.\n- **Auto-Deploy to Surge Rule (Standing Directive):**\n  - *User Directive:* `\"deploy it to surge please...and do so going forward after every new compile\"`\n  - *Status:* **IMPLEMENTATION** (Must re-export web bundle and deploy via `npx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh` after every compilation).\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n- **Domain & Rules:**\n  - Target Company: **ValuTeachers** working with Florida educators on the **Florida Retirement System (FRS)** and **403(b)/457(b)** plans.\n  - Objective: **In-person classroom sit-down during their planning period or room number**.\n  - **AI SMS Quality & Completeness Mandate:** The text messages must never be cut off or truncated. They must be clean, clear, friendly yet professional, and directly incorporate what the educator wrote in their own words (`custom_questions`), their years in FRS, and their checked interests.\n  - **Website Brand Palette:** `5treesfellowship.church`:\n    - Sacred Green: `#244931` / `#14291B` (deep background)\n    - Heavenly Gold: `#D4AF37`\n    - Living White: `#FCFCFA`\n    - Deep Sky Blue: `#0077BE`\n    - Warm Earth Brown: `#56413B`\n  - **Live Surge Domain:** `https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n1. **Identified AI SMS Truncation Root Cause:**\n   - In `src/services/aiSmsService.ts`, `maxOutputTokens: 180` was aggressively truncating the generated SMS mid-sentence.\n2. **Complete 5 Trees Fellowship Theme Overhaul:**\n   - Created centralized design tokens in `src/theme/colors.ts` matching `5treesfellowship.church`.\n   - Updated `App.tsx`, `AppNavigator.tsx`, `dist/index.html`, and `dist/manifest.json`.\n   - Restyled all screens: `ListsScreen.tsx`, `ScanSheetScreen.tsx`, `DialerHudScreen.tsx`, `LeadDetailScreen.tsx`, `SettingsScreen.tsx`, `CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx`, and `AnalyticsScreen.tsx`.\n3. **Completed Bug Fixes from Code Audit:**\n   - Handled bulk deletions (`DELETE FROM leads`, `DELETE FROM lists`, `DELETE FROM call_logs`) and lead recycling queries in `WebDatabase.runAsync`.\n   - Enhanced `WebDatabase.getAllAsync` to parse master queue disposition filters and sorting.\n   - Fixed `ScanSheetScreen.tsx` to automatically load the saved Gemini API key on mount via `useEffect`.\n   - Made route param extraction safe (`route.params?.leadId`) across all detail screens.\n4. **Surge Deployment:**\n   - Built and deployed all theme changes live to `https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n- **AI SMS Architecture (`src/services/aiSmsService.ts`):**\n  - Uses Google Gemini REST API endpoints with candidate model fallback: `gemini-3.6-flash` -> `gemini-2.0-flash` -> `gemini-1.5-flash`.\n  - Must increase `maxOutputTokens` from `180` to at least `600` so Gemini does not truncate messages mid-sentence.\n  - Prompt structure needs explicit instructions to:\n    1. Check if `lead.custom_questions` exists and naturally reference their written words/question.\n    2. Reference their planning period (`lead.planning_period`) or room number (`lead.room_number`).\n    3. Seamlessly incorporate FRS service years (`lead.years_in_frs`) and checked interests (`lead.frs_interests`).\n    4. Keep the output clean, friendly, professional, and end with a complete sentence / natural call-to-action.\n- **Surge Deploy Pipeline:**\n  1. `npx expo export -p web` (in `C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`)\n  2. Inject PWA tags into `dist/index.html` and write `dist/manifest.json`\n  3. `npx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n- `src/theme/colors.ts`: Created official `5treesfellowship.church` color palette tokens.\n- `App.tsx`: Applied Sacred Green background