{"step_index":1107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T16:44:36Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Image Implementations**\n\nI've been looking closely at how images are handled in `DialerHudScreen.tsx`, `ListsScreen.tsx`, and `LeadDetailScreen.tsx`. Currently, each image uses a standard `<Image>` component wrapped in a `<View>` with `imageFrame` styling. Unfortunately, this basic setup lacks support for essential interactive features like pinch-to-zoom, panning, scrolling, and double-tap zoom.\n\n\n**Developing Zoom Capabilities**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing a robust image zooming solution for both React Native and Expo Web. My current plan involves creating a reusable `ZoomableImageModal` component. This component will leverage a `ScrollView` with zoom scaling, pan gestures, and interactive controls, ensuring a consistent and feature-rich experience across platforms, including web's pinch-to-zoom on touch devices, and zoom buttons for mouse/tap interaction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React, { useState } from 'react';\nimport {\n  View,\n  Text,\n  StyleSheet,\n  Modal,\n  TouchableOpacity,\n  Image,\n  ScrollView,\n  SafeAreaView,\n  Dimensions,\n  Platform,\n} from 'react-native';\nimport { X, ZoomIn, ZoomOut, RotateCcw, FileCheck, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react-native';\nimport { Colors } from '../theme/colors';\nimport { HapticsService } from '../services/hapticsService';\n\ninterface ZoomableImageModalProps {\n  visible: boolean;\n  imageUri: string | null;\n  title?: string;\n  subtitle?: string;\n  onClose: () => void;\n}\n\nconst { width: SCREEN_WIDTH, height: SCREEN_HEIGHT } = Dimensions.get('window');\n\nexport default function ZoomableImageModal({\n  visible,\n  imageUri,\n  title = 'Proof of Contact Request',\n  subtitle,\n  onClose,\n}: ZoomableImageModalProps) {\n  const [zoomLevel, setZoomLevel] = useState<number>(1);\n\n  const handleZoomIn = async () => {\n    await HapticsService.tick();\n    setZoomLevel((prev) => Math.min(prev + 0.5, 4));\n  };\n\n  const handleZoomOut = async () => {\n    await HapticsService.tick();\n    setZoomLevel((prev) => Math.max(prev - 0.5, 1));\n  };\n\n  const handleResetZoom = async () => {\n    await HapticsService.tick();\n    setZoomLevel(1);\n  };\n\n  const handleClose = () => {\n    setZoomLevel(1);\n    onClose();\n  };\n\n  if (!visible || !imageUri) return null;\n\n  const baseImageWidth = SCREEN_WIDTH - 32;\n  const baseImageHeight = Math.min(SCREEN_HEIGHT * 0.65, 520);\n\n  return (\n    <Modal visible={visible} animationType=\"fade\" transparent onRequestClose={handleClose}>\n      <View style={styles.modalBackdrop}>\n        <SafeAreaView style={styles.safeContainer}>\n          {/* Header */}\n          <View style={styles.header}>\n            <View style={{ flex: 1 }}>\n              <Text style={styles.title}>{title}</Text>\n              {subtitle ? <Text style={styles.subtitle}>{subtitle}</Text> : null}\n            </View>\n\n            {/* Floating Zoom Controls in Header */}\n            <View style={styles.zoomControls}>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={[styles.zoomBtn, zoomLevel <= 1 && styles.zoomBtnDisabled]}\n                onPress={handleZoomOut}\n                disabled={zoomLevel <= 1}\n              >\n                <ZoomOut size={18} color={zoomLevel <= 1 ? Colors.textMuted : Colors.livingWhite} />\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n\n              <TouchableOpacity style={styles.zoomBtn} onPress={handleResetZoom}>\n                <Text style={styles.zoomBadgeText}>{Math.round(zoomLevel * 100)}%</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={[styles.zoomBtn, zoomLevel >= 4 && styles.zoomBtnDisabled]}\n                onPress={handleZoomIn}\n                disabled={zoomLevel >= 4}\n              >\n                <ZoomIn size={18} color={zoomLevel >= 4 ? Colors.textMuted : Colors.livingWhite} />\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n            </View>\n\n            <TouchableOpacity style={styles.closeBtn} onPress={handleClose}>\n              <X size={22} color={Colors.livingWhite} />\n            </TouchableOpacity>\n          </View>\n\n          {/* Interactive Zoomable Viewport */}\n          <View style={styles.viewportContainer}>\n            <ScrollView\n              style={styles.scrollView}\n              contentContainerStyle={[\n                styles.scrollContent,\n                {\n                  width: baseImageWidth * zoomLevel,\n                  height: baseImageHeight * zoomLevel,\n                  minWidth: '100%',\n                  minHeight: '100%',\n                },\n              ]}\n              maximumZoomScale={4.0}\n              minimumZoomScale={1.0}\n              zoomScale={zoomLevel}\n              showsHorizontalScrollIndicator={true}\n              showsVerticalScrollIndicator={true}\n              pinchGestureEnabled={true}\n              bounces={true}\n              centerContent={true}\n            >\n              <Image\n                source={{ uri: imageUri }}\n                style={{\n                  width: baseImageWidth * zoomLevel,\n                  height: baseImageHeight * zoomLevel,\n                }}\n                resizeMode=\"contain\"\n              />\n            </ScrollView>\n\n            {/* Helper Hint */}\n            <View style={styles.hintOverlay}>\n              <Text style={styles.hintText}>\n                💡 Pinch, scroll, or tap +/- above to zoom into handwritten notes\n              </Text>\n            </View>\n          </View>\n\n          {/* Compliance Footer */}\n          <View style={styles.footer}>\n            <ShieldCheck size={16} color={Colors.statusSitDownText} />\n            <Text style={styles.footerText}>\n              Verified ValuTeachers Card • Stored Securely in Local Device Sandbox\n            </Text>\n          </View>\n        </SafeAreaView>\n      </View>\n    </Modal>\n  );\n}\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  modalBackdrop: {\n    flex: 1,\n    backgroundColor: 'rgba(14, 29, 19, 0.96)',\n  },\n  safeContainer: {\n    flex: 1,\n    paddingHorizontal: 16,\n    paddingVertical: 10,\n    justifyContent: 'space-between',\n  },\n  header: {\n    flexDirection: 'row',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    justifyContent: 'space-between',\n    paddingVertical: 10,\n    borderBottomWidth: 1,\n    borderBottomColor: Colors.borderSubtle,\n    gap: 10,\n  },\n  title: {\n    fontSize: 16,\n    fontWeight: '800',\n    color: Colors.heavenlyGold,\n  },\n  subtitle: {\n    fontSize: 12,\n    color: Colors.textSecondary,\n    marginTop: 2,\n    fontWeight: '600',\n  },\n  zoomControls: {\n    flexDirection: 'row',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    backgroundColor: Colors.bgCard,\n    borderRadius: 20,\n    borderWidth: 1,\n    borderColor: Colors.borderSubtle,\n    paddingHorizontal: 4,\n    paddingVertical: 2,\n    gap: 4,\n  },\n  zoomBtn: {\n    paddingHorizontal: 8,\n    paddingVertical: 6,\n    borderRadius: 14,\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    justifyContent: 'center',\n  },\n  zoomBtnDisabled: {\n    op